    <string name="about_tagline">Musliminut tamanut tamakkersimasumik, akeqanngitsumik, ammasumik inngiaqateqarsinnaasoq — qinusarnermi piffissat, Adhan, Korani, hadith, adhkar allallu, oqaatsitit atorlugit.</string>
    <string name="about_description_title">Muslimit pillugit</string>
    <string name="about_description_body">Muslim tassaavoq Android-imut app-i akeqanngitsumik ammasumillu ulloq naallugu malinnaasinnaasoq: qinusarnermi piffissat astronomiskimik eqqortut Adhan-imik, Qibla-mik kumpassimik eqqortumik, Korani tamakkerlugu atuakkiornermik tafsir-imillu, hadith-inik atuakkiorfik, adhkar-imik pissarsiarineqarsimasoq, elektroniskimik tasbih-imik, Ramadan-imi atortunik, zakat-imik offline-imik suliaqarnermut naatsorsuinermik, offline-imik naatsorsuinermik, privatimik naatsorsuinermik nalinginnaasumik.</string>
    <string name="about_features_title">Højdepunktit</string>
    <string name="about_features_body">Muslimip pisariaqartitai tamarmik app-imi ataatsimi:</string>
    <string name="about_feature_prayer">Qinusarnermi piffissat &amp; Adhan — naatsorsuinermi periutsit tamarmik, inatsisitigut atuarfiit, aamma 18+ adhan-imik nipilersorneq</string>
    <string name="about_feature_quran">Korani tamakkerlugu — Uthmani-mik allagaq, 44-nik atuartitsisut, tafsir, nutserineq, oqaatsinik ujarlerneq &amp; frekvensi</string>
    <string name="about_feature_adhkar">Adhkar, tasbih, Ramadan &amp; Zakat — eqqaamasassanik aammalu qimmit qimuttut atorlugit</string>
    <string name="about_feature_offline">Offline-siullermik — nunat assigi, Korani, hadith aamma adhkar internetimik atuinngitsumik sulipput</string>
    <string name="about_feature_privacy">Inuttut pisinnaatitaaffiit — reklameqanngilaq, malinnaasoqanngilaq, paasissutissaatitit atortumiiginnarput</string>
